  "pipeline": "docs/inverse/datasets/neural-palette-pipeline-results.json",
  "visualReviewRequired": false,
  "findings": [
    "The printed-heart checker remains a checked fit against its derived mask, yet disagrees with 23.87% of the fixed known paper-identity samples; its classifier already disagrees with 23.82%. Decorative print versus underlying paper identity remains a preprocessing limitation, not evidence that all photographed colors should be discarded.",
